+### Maintenance actions
+
+| Action | Parameters |
+|---|---|
+| **Tune-up (everything)** (`tune_up`) ⚠ | *Reboot afterwards*: never (default) or only if the machine needs it. Starts the same [tune-up](Monitoring#tune-up-komplet) as Health → Tune-up with every step on: refresh, full-upgrade with autoremove/autoclean, container updates, `docker system prune -a` (never volumes), image scans, a security audit and a fresh health check. Machines with a tune-up already under way or without a confirmed host key are skipped (0.146.0+) |
